---
layout: base.njk
title: Write With Us
permalink: /write/
---

<header class="wrap page-head">
  <h1 class="page-head__title">Write With Us</h1>
  <p class="page-head__lede">
    {{ site.name }} is open to any student with something worth arguing. You do not need
    experience, a byline elsewhere, or a finished piece — a clear idea is enough to start.
  </p>
  <div class="hero__actions">
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Pitch%20for%20{{ site.name | urlencode }}">
      Become a Contributor
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 class="section-title">Where you could write</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid--3">
    {% set areas = ["Economics", "Finance", "Politics", "Philosophy", "Technology", "International Affairs", "Data & Research"] %}
    {% for area in areas %}
      <div class="area reveal">{{ area }}</div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2 class="section-title">What we're looking for</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid--3">
    {% set criteria = [
      { title: "Original thinking", body: "An argument that is yours, not a restatement of the consensus." },
      { title: "Strong arguments", body: "A clear claim, defended — including against the best objection to it." },
      { title: "Evidence", body: "Data, sources and citations a reader can follow up and check." },
      { title: "Clear writing", body: "Readable by someone outside your discipline without losing precision." },
      { title: "Intellectual curiosity", body: "Questions you actually want answered, not topics you think sound impressive." },
      { title: "Willingness to be edited", body: "We edit for clarity and rigour. Good pieces get better this way." }
    ] %}
    {% for item in criteria %}
      <div class="value reveal">
        <h3 class="value__title">{{ item.title }}</h3>
        <p class="value__body">{{ item.body }}</p>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap prose prose--page">
  <h2>How to pitch</h2>
  <p>Send us three things:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>A working headline.</li>
    <li>A paragraph on the argument you intend to make.</li>
    <li>How you plan to support it — data, sources, or the literature you are drawing on.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    We reply to every pitch. If it is not right for us, we will tell you why rather than leaving
    you guessing.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="wrap cta-band">
  <div class="cta-band__inner">
    <div>
      <h2 class="cta-band__title">Ready to pitch?</h2>
      <p class="cta-band__desc">
        Send your article or idea to {{ site.email }} and we will come back to you.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Pitch%20for%20{{ site.name | urlencode }}">
      Become a Contributor
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
